# Fuel gauge alert below 5%, plugging the charger clears the warning, 2% shuts down.
boot
settle
battery 4 3550
settle
expect screen lowbatt
expect log power: fuel gauge alert
expect panel low_battery.pbm
charger cc
settle
expect screen watchface
charger off
battery 2 3400
wait 61000
settle
expect screen off
expect off
expect noerrors
